  "question": {
    "text": "If the line <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math> touches the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> exactly for one value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>m</mi></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>, then the value of&nbsp;<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math> is equal to",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "1.4",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of the tangent to <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;with slope <math><mi>m</mi></math> is&nbsp;<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;which is same as <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> which is quadratic in <math><mi>&#8216;</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>&#8217;</mi></math></p><p>Since, it has both roots equal<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>36</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
